        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste paper sorting plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste paper sorting plant
The dataset represents a waste paper sorting site with a annual production of 33 kt and a total life time of 50 years.;
UUID: f62ad7bf-c54a-3c7e-af5f-2eda8c3d6faf
this module includes the land-use, buildings (hall and multi-story), the internal parkings and streets, the machineries for box waste paper sorting as well as the dismanteling/disposal of the whole infrastructure
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: estimation of typical technology for sorting of waste paper
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and estimations from similar processes 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f62ad7bf-c54a-3c7e-af5f-2eda8c3d6faf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
